    {
      "_id": "rdty2ceSXXD6bMU3",
      "name": "Command the Frozen",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 0,
      "flags": {},
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Karivek&rsquo;s death at the hands of a supernaturally cold malevolence (the wendigo) has given him ghost power over non-outsider creatures who possess the cold subtype. The ghost can use @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.OsOhx3TGIZ7AhD0P]{Dominate} at will on any non-outsider with the cold trait, but can only maintain control in this manner over one creature at a time.</p>\n<p>Any creature of lower level than Karivek with the cold trait that becomes the target of this ability automatically critically fails on the Will save to resist its effects.</p>"
        },
